<title>UK: MTL Trust preferred bidder for UK's Merseyrail.</title>
<headline>MTL Trust preferred bidder for UK's Merseyrail.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Passenger Rail Franchising (Opraf) said on Thursday it had selected MTL Trust Holdings Ltd as preferred bidder for the Merseyrail Electrics passenger rail franchise. Opraf is in the process of a gradually privatising the country's passenger rail network.</p>
<p>Merseyrail Electrics operates passenger rail services on two lines comprising 75 route miles.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
